Selected Statistics for this Section (if passed, e.g., Median Days to Patch, Top Product):
{% if data_context_payload.section_specific_stats %}
{% for stat_name, stat_value in data_context_payload.section_specific_stats.items() %}
- {{ stat_name | replace("_", " ") | title }}: {{ stat_value }}
{% endfor %}{% endif %}
